                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Free advice from the damp. Past the reeds sits the mist court — a Fairy keeper, charm thick as fog. Steel or poison wilts the mist court fast. Pack a sting before you pack a lunch."
                        }
                    ],
