                            ],
                            Label: "bow_out_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The Company sent an auditor to my hollow. He wrote NON YIELD GROWTH on a clipboard, taped the notice to my oldest log, and billed me for the tape. So now I train what grows on the notice."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You walk fast for spore country. Everything arrives here eventually — rot, rain, the quarterly review. Battles just arrive faster."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "(he stands so still that for a moment you cannot tell him from the stumps) Patience is my whole strategy, trainer. The damp always wins by waiting."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Sporeherd Maslen",
                    Label: "default"
                }
